    {
      "text": "Heat a Dutch oven or large skillet over medium-high heat. Cook and stir beef and onion in the hot Dutch oven until browned and crumbly, 5 to 7 minutes; drain and discard grease.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yleWqe2y2IILliOcHgkxsFzOEdM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235997-unstuffed-cabbage-roll-DDMFS-step-02-6cd5854930c6450ea66a29cf9b12e146.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235997/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cabbage, tomatoes, tomato sauce, water, garlic, salt, and pepper and bring to a boil. Cover Dutch oven, reduce heat, and simmer until cabbage is tender, about 30 minutes.",
